  "toolbar-navigation/v22-toc-margin-light-900": "In a 900 px light theme pane, on a fixture that opens with a 10-column table right after the intro paragraph, the TOC starts closed and opens as a column right of the content below the toolbar; it lists headings of levels 1 to 4 only, never overlaps the text column, either table, the sticky band or the toolbar, keeps the content clear of it in Auto and Full width and at zoom 200 % (centring a table wider than the column on the area left of it in Auto width), scrolls to a heading when its entry is clicked, marks one current entry with at least 4.5:1 contrast and folds sub-entries with its twisty; it is then left open in Margin width mode with at least eight entries, one current heading with square corners and the column fully inside the viewport.",
